          "intro": "Applications for 2027 are open. Applications for our 2027 apprenticeships are open. Take the first steps towards your career today. Apply now Enhanced apprenticeships Our tailored training program, enhanced with modular add-ons, ensures that skills align perfectly with business needs. Designed in collaboration with industry and academia, these modules can be integrated at any stage of the apprenticeship. Explore enhanced apprenticeships Design. Make. Fix. Find your fit in the world of engineering with Design. Make. Fix showing you how your interests can shape your future career. Discover how Apprenticeships View our apprenticeships and earn while you learn continue Employers Employ an apprentice or enrol on CPD courses continue Schools continue Student Life What's On? Sign up to our newsletter Latest Stories Lila-Louise set to complete apprenticeship a year early after winning prestigious award read more Blogs Kathryn Jackson: helping shape an inclusive workforce of the future read mor",
