          "finalUrl": "https://amrctraining.co.uk/about/contact-us",
          "intro": "Home / About / ... How to find us By car The Advanced Manufacturing Park is just off J33 of the M1 signed from the first junction off Sheffield Parkway. By public transport or taxi The High Field Spring/Brunel Way bus stop is just outside the Training Centre, with several bus routes stopping there. Further information on public transport routes to the centre can be found on the Travel South Yorkshire website . We are about 15 minutes by taxi from Sheffield or Rotherham railway station. By air Our nearest airports are East Midlands ; Manchester ; and Leeds Bradford Yorkshire's Airport . All AMRC facilities are wheelchair accessible. Recommended hotels If you need to stay overnight, we can recommend the following hotels: Crowne Plaza Royal Victoria Sheffield Tel.: +44 (0)114 276 8822 Email: stay@cpsheffield.co.uk Holiday Inn Express Sheffield City Centre Tel.: +44 (0)114 252 6500 Email: stay@hiexsheffield.co.uk Leonardo Hotel Sheffield Tel.: +44 (0)114 291 2222 Email: sheffield@leonardoh",
