        "https://www.leeds-art.ac.uk/about-us/find-us": {
          "url": "https://www.leeds-art.ac.uk/about-us/find-us",
          "status": 200,
          "finalUrl": "https://www.leeds-art.ac.uk/about-us/find-us",
          "intro": "About Us Find Us Add to my list We have two buildings which you can find directions and further details about below. Blenheim Walk Leeds Arts University Blenheim Walk Leeds LS2 9AQ This building is situated on Blenheim Walk, at the top of Woodhouse Lane, opposite the Parkinson Tower of the University of Leeds. Our higher education (undergraduate and postgraduate) courses are taught in this building. Vernon Street Leeds Arts University Vernon Street Leeds LS2 8PH Our Vernon Street building is located just off Millennium Square, behind Leeds City Museum. Our Further Education (Foundation Diploma and Extended Diploma) courses are taught in this building. How to get to us by... Walking Cycling Bus Park and Ride Train Car Plane We recommend using Google Maps to search for walkable route directions from your location. Alternatively, you can check out Leeds City Centre walking map for walking routes in and around the city. Blenheim Walk is a 23-minute walk from the train station and a 28-minute walk from the bus station. Vernon Street is an 11-minute walk from the train station and a 14-minute walk from the bus station.",
          "campusSnippets": []
        },
