          "finalUrl": "https://www.hull.ac.uk/study/undergraduate/meet-us",
          "intro": "Meet us Meet us any time , any where , any way See what we’re all about. In person, online or on the road – there’s a way to meet us that works for you. Learn more arrow down play to pause Get to know us, on your terms We know every student journey is different. That’s why we offer a variety of ways to explore our campus, your course, and our community. Whether you’ve got a full day to visit or just an hour online, you’ll find something that works for you. Thinking about your future? So are we . Stay in touch Got questions? We've got answers. Send us a question upload Enquiry WhatsApp +44 (0)7970 385838 upload WhatsApp Email study@hull.ac.uk upload Email",
