          "finalUrl": "https://www.durhamisc.com/international-study-centre",
          "intro": "DURHAM UNIVERSITY INTERNATIONAL STUDY CENTRE Why study abroad at Durham University International Study Centre? You can begin your journey to one of the world’s top 100 universities with us at Durham University International Study Centre. While studying with us, you'll build confidence and academic skills, and get the support you need to thrive at Durham University. Our high-level of support helps you adjust to life in the UK, and our study programmes prepare you for the challenges of degree-level study. The International Study Centre is operated by Study Group – a global leader in providing pathway programmes for international students. We’re the smartest first step on your journey to success. Two campuses, two experiences Your university journey starts with us at the University’s Queen’s Campus in Stockton-on-Tees – an environment designed especially for international students, where you'll build confidence before progressing to Durham University. Smaller classes, personalised support and a welcoming international community help you settle quickly, develop confidence and prepare to progress to Durham University once you have successfully completed your pathway programme. You can book a tour around the Durham International Study Centre (ISC) at Queen’s Campus in Stockton-on-Tees. Book your campus tour here Prepare to thrive at Durham University At the International Study Centre, we help you to develop the skills you need for your chosen degree at Durham University. Our progra",
